1
00:00:01,500 --> 00:00:06,814
Folio helps reviewers compare related documents and follow every signal back to its source.

2
00:00:07,264 --> 00:00:15,361
The demo uses three fictional PDFs. Folio extracts supported fields, records hashes, and compares the values.

3
00:00:15,811 --> 00:00:21,543
Two declarations of annual income differ, so the app raises a review signal with linked evidence.

4
00:00:21,993 --> 00:00:27,337
Select the income proof to inspect extracted lines alongside the original PDF page.

5
00:00:27,787 --> 00:00:34,777
Export the dossier with findings, hashes, evidence references, and limitations in one reviewable file.

6
00:00:35,227 --> 00:00:40,957
These explainable checks are prompts for human review; they do not determine authenticity or fraud.
